<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier league soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Aston Villa 1 (Yorke 15) Leicester 3 (Claridge 8, Parker 43-penalty, Izzet 85). halftime 1-2. Attendance 36,193.</p>
<p>Blackburn 1 (Gallacher 56) Chelsea 1 (Petrescu 82). 0-0. 27,229.</p>
<p>Everton 7 (Stuart 12, Kanchelskis 22, 33, Speed 30, 32, 72, Barmby 57) Southampton 1 (Ostenstad 39). 5-1. 35,669.</p>
<p>Leeds 0 Liverpool 2 (Ruddock 13, McManaman 90). 0-1. 39,981.</p>
<p>Manchester United 1 (Winterburn 63-own goal) Arsenal 0. 0-0. 55,210.</p>
<p>Newcastle 1 (Beardsley 83) West Ham 1 (Rowland 23). 0-1. 36,552.</p>
<p>Tottenham 2 (Sinton 13, Sheringham 82) Sunderland 0. 1-0. 31,867.</p>
<p>Wimbledon 2 (Earle 45, Gayle 54) Coventry 2 (Whelan 56, Dublin 70). 1-0. 10,307.</p>
